You are a senior backend + mobile architect. Build a production-ready MVP for a "DoOrPay".

## 🎯 Product Overview

We are building an app where:

* Users create tasks with alarms
* They must COMPLETE tasks (not just dismiss alarms)
* App tracks streak
* Future: verification, AI motivation, penalties

---

# 🧱 TECH STACK

## Backend:

* Language: Go (Golang)
* Framework: httprouter
* Database: PostgreSQL
* ORM: GORM or SQLC
* Auth: JWT-based authentication
* Notifications: Firebase Cloud Messaging (FCM)
* Storage (later phases): AWS S3
* Payments (later): Razorpay
* Queue (later): Redis

## Frontend:

* Flutter (only structure, not full UI)

---

# ⚙️ PHASE 1 REQUIREMENTS (MVP)

## Features:

1. User Authentication

   * Signup (email + password)
   * Login (JWT)

2. Task Management

   * Create task (title, time, repeat type)
   * Get all tasks
   * Update task
   * Delete task

3. Alarm System

   * Background scheduler (cron in Go)
   * Every minute check tasks
   * Trigger notification (mock or log if FCM not set)

4. Task Completion

   * Mark task as completed

5. Streak System

   * Track daily streak
   * Reset streak if missed

